flowchart TD
    U[User] --> UI[Hermes Web/API Interface]
    UI --> RET[Hybrid Retriever]
    RET --> VEC[Vector Index]
    RET --> KW[Keyword/BM25 Index]
    RET --> META[Metadata Filter]
    RET --> EV[Evidence Builder]
    EV --> LLM[Grounded Reasoning Model]
    LLM --> VER[Verification Layer]
    VER --> ANS[Answer + Evidence Trace]
    ANS --> U

    SRC[Source Documents] --> ING[Ingestion Service]
    ING --> CH[Chunking Engine]
    CH --> REF[Semantic Refinement]
    REF --> STORE[Dual Context Store]
    STORE --> VEC
    STORE --> KW
    STORE --> META
